{
  "id": "a2d4b9e867eb463da1e60fbf02bc5799",
  "title": "FailSafe 6.0.12: From Change to Confidence",
  "sample_rate": 48000,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "07f71ac1b1db4fc7ba9ac9729c11e587",
      "kind": "voice",
      "name": "Narration (Guide)",
      "clips": [
        {
          "id": "3e1940ea774346b4b5f293bed676bf1d",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 48000,
          "frame_count": 435342,
          "asset_id": "voice_1d6678ae7f5c5abdcea2542ef355daa725a4b71e2558b35da37a7582ef7d4abc",
          "text": "AI can help you write code faster. But when something changes, how do you know what happened, what it affects, and whether it's ready to ship?",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "d9b35338d1a44258a9ba15d566467795",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 537600,
          "frame_count": 527644,
          "asset_id": "voice_daa35ff56b9ecd2ce96c68188b542ff280a015a219c1d0df64c4b0493c259610",
          "text": "Meet FailSafe. A development companion that helps solo developers keep their work visible, understand potential risks, and maintain a record of important decisions.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "9ba5771e0c1341bc8821f6fc0e1edf10",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 1113600,
          "frame_count": 425814,
          "asset_id": "voice_5d77caa599530de551aab501ca69b2a3d6a4349153f9e0e3503314de59a54b18",
          "text": "Setup starts in the Console. Install the Qor-Logic skills, approve the request in VS Code, and the workspace is ready.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "cd59dadea2544bd087f491552a0ea42b",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 1617600,
          "frame_count": 787912,
          "asset_id": "voice_3f74dbbdc6e38f0a27d07ed10c708d0ddf5ef591fdbf40488ad0bf3b76dc7084",
          "text": "With version 6.0.12, the Console, Monitor, and SRE views share a consistent visual experience. Change your theme, and your workspace follows. The information stays familiar, wherever you're working.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "2883532f32ff47598eb43d6a5603f759",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 2452800,
          "frame_count": 624356,
          "asset_id": "voice_c5d4c3119061d8ca574a44eaa1b081c91f2f65362bb2ac7ab389a7f0a01297e8",
          "text": "Now imagine a small but important bug. A date validator accepts a day that doesn't exist. We document the issue, write a regression test, and see the failure for ourselves.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "1eb04861a6a241abb23a9c621e57dbb8",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 3124800,
          "frame_count": 501192,
          "asset_id": "voice_bfb55966ba72b4607f487adcb36b9b25233aaa0869b38ee5da47a136f54377c8",
          "text": "Fixing the code is only part of the job. FailSafe helps surface the risks and governance requirements around a change, so the developer knows what still needs attention.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "33dd79dacb954e4f8676dbbbebfd2402",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 3672000,
          "frame_count": 494222,
          "asset_id": "voice_94aeec5163181800983bdb15a5079919bef6141966fbaa4d5ebc8412561f250d",
          "text": "The corrected validator passes its tests. We can inspect the difference, see the recorded decisions, and compare the result with what we intended to change.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "7aee60cbaead40eaadde003f6731d7ef",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 4209600,
          "frame_count": 560214,
          "asset_id": "voice_e323cc7d830a25e4888152b510e2c594a844716698eb406f00e2f42132cc517f",
          "text": "Every change has a story. What we set out to do, what we changed, what we checked, and what still needs review. FailSafe helps make that story easier to follow.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "0ad3597674e04efba781074980b2d026",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 4819200,
          "frame_count": 374756,
          "asset_id": "voice_295ad6b83a87ea18c1f6850db9657c82081a212ba0eff0275d0359ee71a1f21c",
          "text": "Move faster without losing sight of the work. FailSafe. Build with AI. Know what changed.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
